C:\Users\suzuk\.codex\sessions\2026\03\15\rollout-2026-03-15T02-19-47-019ced5c-7e45-7632-a723-334c333001d1.jsonl-168-{"timestamp":"2026-03-14T17:23:46.786Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_pExRHGOUFoxaLzNwrq4dN2YI","output":"Exit code: 0\nWall time: 0.5 seconds\nTotal output lines: 105\nOutput:\nC:\\Users\\suzuk\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\03\\09\\rollout-2026-03-09T01-17-03-019cce3c-e470-7a32-beec-6f4df13232f3.jsonl:191:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-08T16:36:17.856Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_rJxyb2EPSmMg3mTk7CUm8ULb\",\"output\":\"Exit code: 0\\nWall time: 0.3 seconds\\nOutput:\\n﻿<!DOCTYPE html>\\r\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\r\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"FACT SIM is a browser-based discrete-event simulator for factories, AGVs, logistics, traffic, and other real-world systems.\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#f5f5f7\\\" />\\n  <title>FACT SIM - Browser-Based Discrete Event Simulation</title>\\n  <script>\\r\\n    (function(){\\r\\n      try{\\r\\n        var qs = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search || '');\\r\\n        if(qs.get('skipLanding') === '1'){\\r\\n          document.documentElement.classList.add('skip-landing');\\r\\n        }\\r\\n      }catch(_e){}\\r\\n    })();\\r\\n  </script>\\r\\n  <link rel=\\\"icon\\\" type=\\\"image/png\\\" href=\\\"img/fact_sim_logo.png\\\" />\\r\\n  <link rel=\\\"apple-touch-icon\\\" href=\\\"img/fact_sim_logo.png\\\" />\\r\\n\\r\\n  <!-- LiteGraph -->\\r\\n  <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/litegraph.js/0.7.13/css/litegraph.min.css\\\" />\\r\\n  <script src=\\\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/litegraph.js/0.7.13/build/litegraph.min.js\\\"></script>\\r\\n  <script src=\\\"js/nodes-config.js?v=20260226a\\\"></script>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"css/app.css?v=20260308f\\\" />\\n</head>\\r\\n<body>\\n<main id=\\\"landing\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"landingTitle\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"landingSkip\\\" href=\\\"#landingOpenBtn\\\">Skip to simulator</a>\\n  <div class=\\\"landingShell\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"landingTopbar\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"landingWordmark\\\" href=\\\"#landingTitle\\\" aria-label=\\\"FACT SIM landing top\\\">\\n        <img class=\\\"landingWordmarkLogo\\\" src=\\\"img/fact_sim_logo.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <span>FACT SIM</span>\\n      </a>\\n      <nav class=\\\"landingNav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Landing sections\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"#landingConcept\\\">Concept</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#landingFeatures\\\">Features</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#landingGithub\\\">GitHub</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"landingHero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"landingHeroGrid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"landingHeroMain\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"landingEyebrow\\\">Browser-Based Industrial Simulation</p>\\n          <h1 id=\\\"landingTitle\\\">FACT SIM</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"landingSubtitle\\\">Real World Discrete Event Simulation</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"landingBody\\\">\\n            Model factories, production lines, AGVs, logistics, hospitals, and other real-world\\n            systems as discrete events with second-level precision.\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"landingActions\\\">\\n            <button id=\\\"landingOpenBtn\\\" class=\\\"landingBtn landingBtnPrimary\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-landing-open disabled aria-disabled=\\\"true\\\">Open Simulator</button>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"landingProgressWrap\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"landingProgressHead\\\">\\n              <span id=\\\"landingProgressLabel\\\" class=\\\"landingProgressStatus\\\">Loading simulator assets...</span>\\n              <span id=\\\"landingProgressValue\\\">0%</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div id=\\\"landingProgressBar\\\" class=\\\"landingProgressBar\\\" role=\\\"progressbar\\\" aria-label=\\\"Loading progress\\\" aria-valuemin=\\\"0\\\" aria-valuemax=\\\"100\\\" aria-valuenow=\\\"0\\\">\\n              <div id=\\\"landingProgressFill\\\" class=\\\"landingProgressFill\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"landingProgressMeta\\\">\\n              <span id=\\\"landingProgressHint\\\">Preparing the browser runtime, UI, and simulation modules.</span>\\n              <span id=\\\"landingProgressState\\\" class=\\\"landingProgressState\\\">Booting</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <aside class=\\\"landingHeroAside\\\" aria-label=\\\"What FACT SIM helps answer\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"landingMetricCard\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"landingMetricEyebrow\\\">What you can validate</p>\\n            <ul class=\\\"landingMetricList\\\">\\n              <li><strong>Takt feasibility</strong><span>Will the line actually meet target cycle time?</span></li>\\n              <li><strong>Throughput</strong><span>How much output can the system sustain per hour?</span></li>\\n              <li><strong>Bottlenecks</strong><span>Which station, carrier, or buffer is constraining flow?</span></li>\\n              <li><strong>Resource sizing</strong><span>How many machines, AGVs, carriers, or pallets are enough?</span></li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section id=\\\"landingConcept\\\" class=\\\"landingSection landingSectionConcept\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"landingSectionHead\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"landingSectionTitle\\\">The world moves through events and state transitions.</h2>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"landingConceptGrid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"landingConceptMain\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"landingSectionLead\\\">“The world can be represented by state transitions and events.”</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"landingSectionText\\\">\\n            Factories, robots, cars, AGVs, and people are all systems of connected events.\\n            FACT SIM models this structure directly so you can validate decisions before deployment.\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"landingPills\\\">\\n            <span>Factories</span>\\n            <span>Robots</span>\\n            <span>Cars</span>\\n            <span>AGVs</span>\\n            <span>People</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"landingConceptStack\\\">\\n          <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\">\\n            <h3>States</h3>\\n            <p>Idle, process, wait, down, blocked, reserved, occupied.</p>\\n          </article>\\n          <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\">\\n            <h3>Events</h3>\\n            <p>Arrivals, handoffs, releases, merges, splits, routing, downtime.</p>\\n          </article>\\n          <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\">\\n            <h3>Decisions</h3>\\n            <p>Validate the reason a line meets takt or fails before equipment is purchased.</p>\\n          </article>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section id=\\\"landingFeatures\\\" class=\\\"landingSection\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"landingSectionHead\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"landingSectionTitle\\\">Built for analysis, not presentation-only animation.</h2>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"landingGrid landingGrid3\\\">\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Node-Based Modeling</h3><p>Build systems visually using a graph model.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Discrete-Event Engine</h3><p>Simulate state transitions and event timing accurately.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Second-Level Precision</h3><p>Analyze process flow with practical temporal resolution.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Browser Native</h3><p>Run instantly with no installation or license server.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Lightweight</h3><p>Fast iteration on everyday laptops and workstations.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Open Source</h3><p>Transparent architecture for extension and audit.</p></article>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section id=\\\"landingUseCases\\\" class=\\\"landingSection\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"landingSectionHead\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"landingSectionTitle\\\">Model real systems with discrete-event logic.</h2>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"landingGrid landingGrid2\\\">\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Factory Production Lines</h3><p>Validate takt, throughput, and bottleneck risk early.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>AGV Logistics</h3><p>Evaluate route, carrier, and handoff synchronization.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Traffic Simulation</h3><p>Explore event-based flow behavior under constraints.</p></article>\\n        <article class=\\\"landingCardMini\\\"><h3>Hospital Patient Flow</h3><p>Model arrivals, queues, and resource allocation.</p></article>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section id=\\\"landingGithub\\\" class=\\\"landingSection landingSectionGithub\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"landingSectionHead\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"landingSectionTitle\\\">Open source, inspectable, and easy to extend.</h2>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"landingSectionText\\\">\\n        FACT SIM is built as an open platform for industrial and operational simulation.\\n        Explore the code, open issues, fork the modeler, and adapt it for your own domain.\\n      </p>\\n      <a class=\\\"landingInlineLink\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/suzuking001/fact_sim\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Explore Repository</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer class=\\\"landingFooter\\\">\\n      <p class=\\\"landingLegal\\\">Open-source software provided as-is. Validate outputs with your domain data before production decisions.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"landingFooterLinks\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"docs/research.md\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Research Notes</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Third-Party Notices</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</main>\\n<div id=\\\"appRoot\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<button id=\\\"menuToggle\\\" aria-label=\\\"Toggle menu\\\">&#9776;</button>\\r\\n<div id=\\\"sidebar\\\">\\r\\n    <div id=\\\"sidebarHeader\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"appBrandRow\\\">\\n        <img class=\\\"appLogo\\\" src=\\\"img/fact_sim_logo.png\\\" alt=\\\"fact sim logo\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"appBrandText\\\">FACT_SIM</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div id=\\\"controls\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Simulation</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"btn-row\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"btnStart\\\">Start</button>\\r\\n        <button id=\\\"btnStop\\\">Stop</button>\\r\\n        <button id=\\\"btnReset\\\">Reset</button>\\r\\n      </div>\\r\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"speedRange\\\">Speed <span id=\\\"speedFactor\\\">1.0x</span></label>\\n        <input type=\\\"range\\\" id=\\\"speedRange\\\" value=\\\"2\\\" min=\\\"0\\\" max=\\\"12\\\" step=\\\"1\\\">\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"exampleSelect\\\">Example</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"exampleSelect\\\" title=\\\"Examples\\\">\\n          <option value=\\\"\\\">Load example…</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"simple\\\">Simple</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"branch\\\">Branch</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"shuttle_line5\\\">Shuttle Line (5 Stage)</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"carrier_config\\\">Carrier Config Example</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"pallet_station_demo\\\">Pallet Station Demo</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"sample_line1\\\">Sample Line1</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"sample_line2\\\">Sample Line2</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n      <div id=\\\"simStatusCard\\\" class=\\\"simStatusCard\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"simStatusHead\\\">\\n          <span id=\\\"simStatusBadge\\\" class=\\\"simStatusBadge\\\">Stopped</span>\\n          <span id=\\\"simStatusEngine\\\" class=\\\"simStatusEngine\\\">dt (0.1s fixed)</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"simStatusGrid\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"simStatusItem\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"simStatusLabel\\\">Render</span>\\n            <strong id=\\\"simStatusRender\\\">60 FPS</strong>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"simStatusItem\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"simStatusLabel\\\">Realtime</span>\\n            <strong id=\\\"simStatusRealtime\\\">--</strong>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"simStatusItem\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"simStatusLabel\\\">Speed</span>\\n            <strong id=\\\"simStatusSpeed\\\">1x</strong>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"simStatusItem\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"simStatusLabel\\\">Selection</span>\\n            <strong id=\\\"simStatusSelection\\\">0 nodes</strong>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"sidebarMetaFooter\\\">\\n        <div id=\\\"overviewQuickTip\\\" class=\\\"panel-help panel-help-compact\\\">Load an example, then press Start.</div>\\n        <div id=\\\"accessCounter\\\" class=\\\"accessCounter\\\" title=\\\"Public access counter (CounterAPI)\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"accessCounterLabel\\\">Visits</span>\\n          <span id=\\\"accessCounterValue\\\">...</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div id=\\\"backgroundPanel\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Layout Image</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"btn-row\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"bgLayoutLoadBtn\\\">Add Image</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"bgLayoutClearBtn\\\">Remove</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <input type=\\\"file\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutFileInput\\\" accept=\\\"image/*\\\" hidden>\\n      <div id=\\\"bgLayoutEmptyState\\\" class=\\\"panel-help panel-help-compact\\\">Import a floor plan or layout image, then align nodes over it.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bgLayoutEnabled\\\">Show Image</label>\\n        <input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutEnabled\\\" checked>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bgLayoutMouseEdit\\\">Mouse Edit</label>\\n        <input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutMouseEdit\\\">\\n      </div>\\n      <details id=\\\"bgLayoutAdjustDetails\\\" class=\\\"panelDetails\\\">\\n        <summary>Adjust Image</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutX\\\">X</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutX\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutY\\\">Y</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutY\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutW\\\">Width</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutW\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutH\\\">Height</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutH\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutRotation\\\">Rotation (deg)</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutRotation\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"-180\\\" max=\\\"180\\\" value=\\\"0\\\">\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"bgLayoutOpacity\\\">Opacity <span id=\\\"bgLayoutOpacityValue\\\">0.35</span></label>\\n          <input type=\\\"range\\\" id=\\\"bgLayoutOpacity\\\" min=\\\"0.05\\\" max=\\\"1\\\" step=\\\"0.05\\\" value=\\\"0.35\\\">\\n        </div>\\n      </details>\\n    </div>\\n    <!-- Add Node panel -->\\n    <div id=\\\"addNodePanel\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Add Node</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"nodeTypeSearch\\\">Search</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"nodeTypeSearch\\\" type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search node types\\\">\\n      </div>\\n      <div id=\\\"nodeQuickPicks\\\" class=\\\"quick-pick-row\\\" aria-label=\\\"Quick node picks\\\"></div>\\n      <div id=\\\"nodeKindDescription\\\" class=\\\"panel-help panel-help-compact\\\">Choose a preset. Open settings only when you need custom defaults.</div>\\n      <details id=\\\"nodeTypeBrowseDetails\\\" class=\\\"panelDetails\\\">\\n        <summary>Browse All Types</summary>\\n        <div id=\\\"nodeCategoryTabs\\\" class=\\\"category-tabs\\\" role=\\\"tablist\\\" aria-label=\\\"Node categories\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"nodeKindSelect\\\">Node type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"nodeKindSelect\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"equip\\\">Equipment</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"note\\\">Memo</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"signal\\\">Signal</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"shuttle\\\">Shuttle Stage</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"source\\\">Source</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"sink\\\">Sink</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"split\\\">Split</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"branch\\\">Branch</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"agvroute\\\">AGV Route</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"carrierconfig\\\">Carrier Config</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"palletcarrierconfig\\\">Pallet Carrier Config</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"carrierroute\\\">Carrier Route</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"station\\\">Station</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"merge\\\">Merge</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"join\\\">Join</option>\\n          </select>\\n        </div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details id=\\\"nodeSettingsDetails\\\" class=\\\"panelDetails\\\">\\n        <summary>Node Settings</summary>\\n        <div id=\\\"addNodeProps\\\" class=\\\"propFields\\\"></div>\\n      </details>\\n      <button id=\\\"btnAddNode\\\">Place Node</button>\\n    </div>\\n    <div id=\\\"addGroupPanel\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Add Stop Group</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"groupKindSelect\\\">Pattern</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"groupKindSelect\\\"></select>\\n      </div>\\n      <div id=\\\"groupStopRate\\\" class=\\\"group-stop-rate\\\">Downtime: -</div>\\n      <div id=\\\"groupKindDescription\\\" class=\\\"panel-help panel-help-compact\\\">Choose a pattern. Open settings only when timing needs tuning.</div>\\n      <details id=\\\"groupSettingsDetails\\\" class=\\\"panelDetails\\\">\\n        <summary>Pattern Settings</summary>\\n        <div id=\\\"addGroupProps\\\" class=\\\"propFields\\\"></div>\\n      </details>\\n      <button id=\\\"btnAddGroup\\\">Place Group</button>\\n    </div>\\n    <div id=\\\"advancedPanel\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Performance</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"renderFpsSelect\\\">Render FPS</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"renderFpsSelect\\\">\\n          <option value=\\\"15\\\">15</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"30\\\">30</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"60\\\" selected>60</option>\\n        </select>\\r\\n      </div>\\r\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group realtimeFpsGroup\\\">\\r\\n        <label for=\\\"realtimeFpsValue\\\">Realtime FPS</label>\\r\\n        <div id=\\\"realtimeFpsValue\\\" class=\\\"realtimeFpsValue\\\">--</div>\\r\\n      </div>\\r\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group realtimeFactorGroup\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"realtimeFactorValue\\\">Realtime Speed</label>\\n        <div id=\\\"realtimeFactorValue\\\" class=\\\"realtimeFactorValue\\\">--</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"control-group\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"simModeSelect\\\">Engine</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"simModeSelect\\\">\\n          <option value=\\\"dt\\\">dt (0.1s fixed)</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"event\\\">event (heap)</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"event-fast\\\">event-fast (compiled)</option>\\n        </select>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"performanceActionsRow\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"btnBenchmark\\\">Benchmark</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"btnEngineTest\\\" class=\\\"button-secondary\\\">Engine Test</button>\\n      </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div id=\\\"shortcutPanel\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"panelHeader\\\">Canvas Tools</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcuts\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcut-group-label\\\">Most Used</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcut-row\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-action\\\">Box Select</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-key\\\">Ctrl + Drag</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-spacer\\\"></span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcut-row\\\">\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-action\\\">Copy</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-key\\\">Ctrl + C</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-spacer\\\"></span>\\r\\n        </div>\\r\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcut-row\\\">\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-action\\\">Paste</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-key\\\">Ctrl + V</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-spacer\\\"></span>\\r\\n        </div>\\r\\n        <div class=\\\"shortcut-row\\\">\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-action\\\">Delete Selected Node</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-key\\\">Delete</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\\"shortcut-spacer\\\"></span>\\r\\n        </div>\\r\\n        <div class=\\…252144 tokens truncated…列処理\\n- cut edge だけ message/pass buffer で同期\\n\\n**ファイル設計**\\n- 新規 [engine-fast.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast.js)\\n  - mode 登録と entry\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-compiler.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compiler.js)\\n  - graph -> compiled runtime\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-kernels.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-kernels.js)\\n  - specialized kernels\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-worker.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-worker.js)\\n  - 後で追加\\n- 既存 [engine.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine.js#L754)\\n  - 最後に `event-fast` を登録する程度に留める\\n\\n**検証の組み込み**\\n新 engine は最初から `Engine Test` と `High-Perf Benchmark` 前提で作るべきです。\\n- 正しさは [engine-test.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-test.js#L347) で差分検証\\n- 速度は [benchmark.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/benchmark.js#L141) とは別の高性能 benchmark で比較\\n- AI 改善ループは `event-fast*` 系ファイルだけ触る\\n\\n**実装順**\\n1. compile 層\\n2. fallback だけで動く `event-fast`\\n3. engine test で `dt/event/event-fast` 比較\\n4. 専用 kernel 追加\\n5. Worker 化\\n6. partition 並列化\\n\\n次は、この方針をそのままコードに落とせる `event-fast v1 の仕様書` にします。`データ構造`, `API`, `fallback 戦略`, `最初に対応する node 一覧` まで切れます。\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\"},{\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"input_text\",\"text\":\"# Context from my IDE setup:\\n\\n## Active file: c:\\\\Users\\\\suzuk\\\\.continue\\\\config.yaml\\n\\n## Open tabs:\\n- config.yaml: c:\\\\Users\\\\suzuk\\\\.continue\\\\config.yaml\\n\\n## My request for Codex:\\nおねがいします。将来的にマルチスレッドにすることも考慮してね。\\n\"}]},{\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"text\":\"では、`既存 dt/event はそのまま` にした上で、`将来マルチスレッド化できる event-fast` の仕様を切ります。基準にする既存実装は [engine.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine.js) と、検証系は [engine-test.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-test.js) です。\\n\\n**新エンジンの位置づけ**\\n- 新モード名は `event-fast`\\n- 将来版は `event-fast-worker`, `event-fast-par`\\n- 既存 `dt/event` は無変更\\n- UI, MCP, Engine Test では `dt / event / event-fast` を並列比較できるようにする\\n\\n**ファイル構成**\\n- 新規 [engine-fast.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast.js)\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-compiler.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compiler.js)\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-runtime.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-runtime.js)\\n- 新規 [engine-fast-kernels.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-kernels.js)\\n- 将来追加 [engine-fast-worker.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-worker.js)\\n\\n**v1 アーキテクチャ**\\n- `compiler`\\n  - `LGraph` を 1 回だけ読み、実行用の `compiled graph` を作る\\n  - `nodeId -> dense index` 変換\\n  - link を object ではなく配列化\\n  - stop group 所属を bitset 化\\n  - node type を `kindId` 化\\n- `runtime`\\n  - typed array 中心で状態保持\\n  - `deadlines`, `stateFlags`, `dirtyFlags`, `groupMask`, `queueIndex`\\n  - event queue は専用 min-heap\\n  - same-time event は batch 処理\\n- `kernel`\\n  - node type ごとに `execute(nodeIndex, nowMs, ctx)` を持つ\\n  - v1 は未対応 node を compatibility fallback へ送る\\n\\n**v1 で持つデータ構造**\\n- `Int32Array nodeIds`\\n- `Uint16Array kindIds`\\n- `Uint8Array stateFlags`\\n- `Float64Array untilMs`\\n- `Uint32Array firstOutEdge`\\n- `Uint32Array outEdgeCount`\\n- `Int32Array outTargets`\\n- `Uint32Array groupBits`\\n- `Uint8Array fallbackMask`\\n- `Int32Array heapNodeIndex`\\n- `Float64Array heapTime`\\n- `Uint32Array heapSeq`\\n\\nこれなら後で `SharedArrayBuffer` にそのまま移せます。ここが将来のマルチスレッド対応の核心です。\\n\\n**互換戦略**\\n- v1 の専用 kernel 対応 node\\n  - `Source`\\n  - `Equipment`\\n  - `Sink`\\n  - `Branch`\\n  - `Merge`\\n  - `Split`\\n  - `Buffer` 系\\n- 未対応 node\\n  - fallback adapter で既存 node object を実行\\n- これで最初から全 node 対応を目指さず、早く成立させる\\n\\n**マルチスレッドを見据えた制約**\\n- runtime は DOM に触れない\\n- runtime は `window` 依存を持たない\\n- node object 参照を hot path に残さない\\n- event ordering は `time + stable seq` で決定的にする\\n- compile 結果は JSON 化できる形にする\\n- runtime state は `ArrayBuffer / SharedArrayBuffer` へ載せ替え可能にする\\n- stop group は polling ではなく boundary event として表現する\\n\\n**将来の並列化方式**\\n- 第1段階\\n  - `event-fast-worker`\\n  - 1 Worker で engine を回し、UI thread と分離\\n  - 操作感改善が目的\\n- 第2段階\\n  - `event-fast-par`\\n  - graph partition 単位で Worker 分割\\n  - partition 間は boundary queue で同期\\n- 第3段階\\n  - scenario pack benchmark を複数 Worker で並列実行\\n  - これは engine 内部並列より先に効果が出やすい\\n\\n**最初にやらないこと**\\n- いきなり node object を複数 Worker で共有する\\n- `LGraph` をそのまま並列実行する\\n- 既存 `event` の継承改造で済ませようとする\\n- render と simulation を同じ thread 設計のまま最適化する\\n\\n**API**\\n- `App.createSimEngine('event-fast', graph)`\\n- engine instance:\\n  - `reset()`\\n  - `update(simDeltaMs)`\\n  - `stop()`\\n  - `getDebugStats()`\\n- compiler:\\n  - `App.compileFastGraph(graph, options)`\\n- runtime:\\n  - `App.createFastRuntime(compiled, options)`\\n\\n**検証条件**\\n- `Engine Test` で `dt/event/event-fast` を比較できる\\n- `sample_line1` で既存 `event` と completion 差分が許容範囲内\\n- stop group ありでも PASS\\n- headless benchmark で既存 `event` より速い\\n- live graph を汚さない\\n\\n**実装順**\\n1. `compiler` 追加\\n2. fallback のみで動く `event-fast v0`\\n3. `Engine Test` に `event-fast` 登録\\n4. 高頻度 node の専用 kernel 化\\n5. `event-fast-worker`\\n6. partition 情報付き compiler\\n7. `event-fast-par`\\n\\n次は、この仕様をそのまま実装に入れるための `engine-fast v1 のファイル別タスク` に落とします。\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\"},{\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"input_text\",\"text\":\"# Context from my IDE setup:\\n\\n## Active file: c:\\\\Users\\\\suzuk\\\\.continue\\\\config.yaml\\n\\n## Open tabs:\\n- config.yaml: c:\\\\Users\\\\suzuk\\\\.continue\\\\config.yaml\\n\\n## My request for Codex:\\nおねがいします\\n\"}]},{\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"text\":\"では、`event-fast v1` をそのまま実装に入れるためのファイル別タスクに落とします。前提は固定です。`dt/event` は既存のまま残し、新規追加だけで進めます。基準になる既存ファイルは [engine.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine.js) と [engine-test.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-test.js) です。\\n\\n**実装方針**\\n- v1 は `単一スレッド`\\n- 将来 Worker / 並列化できるデータ構造にしておく\\n- まずは `fallback 付きで動く event-fast`\\n- 既存 `dt/event` は改造しない\\n- 既存 `Benchmark` もそのまま\\n\\n**追加ファイル**\\n- [engine-fast-mode.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-mode.js)\\n- [engine-fast-compiler.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compiler.js)\\n- [engine-fast-runtime.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-runtime.js)\\n- [engine-fast-kernels.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-kernels.js)\\n- [engine-fast-compat.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compat.js)\\n- 将来用 [engine-fast-worker.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-worker.js)\\n\\n**1. [engine-fast-mode.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-mode.js)**\\n役割:\\n- `event-fast` を mode として登録\\n- 既存 `App.createSimEngine` をラップ\\n- 既存 `App.getSupportedSimModes` を拡張\\n- `normalizeSimMode`, `getSimModeLabel`, `setSimMode`, `getSimMode` を `event-fast` 対応にする\\n\\n実装ポイント:\\n- 既存関数を退避して wrapper で拡張\\n- `event-fast`, `fast`, `eventfast` を `event-fast` に正規化\\n- 既存 `dt/event` の挙動は変えない\\n- `App.createSimEngine('event-fast', graph)` で新 engine を返す\\n\\n完了条件:\\n- UI の engine select に `event-fast` を追加できる\\n- `dt/event` の動作は変わらない\\n- `event-fast` が `dt` に丸められない\\n\\n**2. [engine-fast-compiler.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compiler.js)**\\n役割:\\n- `LGraph` を実行用の compiled graph に変換する\\n\\n出力イメージ:\\n```js\\n{\\n  nodeCount,\\n  linkCount,\\n  nodeIds,\\n  kindIds,\\n  fallbackMask,\\n  firstOutEdge,\\n  outEdgeCount,\\n  outTargets,\\n  inCounts,\\n  groupBits,\\n  meta\\n}\\n```\\n\\n実装ポイント:\\n- `nodeId -> dense index`\\n- `kindId` への変換テーブル\\n- 出力リンクを配列化\\n- stop group 所属を bit 化\\n- 未対応 node は `fallbackMask=1`\\n- ここでは runtime 状態を持たない\\n\\n完了条件:\\n- 同じ graph から決定的に同じ compiled 出力が出る\\n- `getNodeById()` を runtime hot path で不要にできる\\n- compiled 結果が JSON 化できる\\n\\n**3. [engine-fast-kernels.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-kernels.js)**\\n役割:\\n- node 種別ごとの実行関数をまとめる\\n\\nv1 対応対象:\\n- `Source`\\n- `Equipment`\\n- `Sink`\\n- `Branch`\\n- `Merge`\\n- `Split`\\n\\nAPI:\\n```js\\nApp.fastKernels = {\\n  execute(kindId, nodeIndex, nowMs, ctx) {},\\n  getEventUntil(kindId, nodeIndex, nowMs, ctx) {}\\n}\\n```\\n\\n実装ポイント:\\n- kernel は object lookup を最小化\\n- 返り値は `nextUntil`, `stateChanged`, `outputsChanged` などの軽量情報\\n- 未対応種別はここで扱わず compat へ逃がす\\n\\n完了条件:\\n- 上記 node だけで構成された graph は compat なしで動く\\n- kernel は DOM や `window` に依存しない\\n\\n**4. [engine-fast-compat.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-compat.js)**\\n役割:\\n- 未対応 node を既存 node object 経由で動かす fallback\\n- v1 を早く成立させるための保険\\n\\nAPI:\\n```js\\nApp.createFastCompatAdapter = function(graph, compiled) {}\\n```\\n\\n責務:\\n- dense index から元 node を引く\\n- `onExecute()` 呼び出し\\n- `getEventUntil()` の取得\\n- state 差分を runtime 用フォーマットへ返す\\n\\n完了条件:\\n- 専用 kernel 未対応 node があっても `event-fast` が落ちない\\n- fallback 使用率を stats で取れる\\n\\n**5. [engine-fast-runtime.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-runtime.js)**\\n役割:\\n- `event-fast` 本体\\n- compiled graph を使って update を回す\\n\\n内部状態:\\n- `Float64Array untilMs`\\n- `Uint8Array stateFlags`\\n- `Uint32Array dirtyEpoch`\\n- `Uint8Array fallbackMask`\\n- `Int32Array heapNodeIndex`\\n- `Float64Array heapTime`\\n- `Uint32Array heapSeq`\\n\\nクラス案:\\n```js\\nclass EventFastEngine {\\n  constructor(graph, options) {}\\n  reset() {}\\n  update(simDeltaMs) {}\\n  stop() {}\\n  getDebugStats() {}\\n}\\n```\\n\\n実装ポイント:\\n- 起動時に compile\\n- same-time event を batch 処理\\n- heap は専用実装\\n- stop group は boundary event 化\\n- runtime は headless 前提\\n- timeline / draw は既存 engine 同様に外で扱う\\n\\n完了条件:\\n- `update()` が clone