I’ve isolated a narrow host-side hotspot in `event-fast-par`: each parallel step flattens every worker’s emitted messages into temporary arrays before rebucketing them by partition. I’m replacing that with direct rebucketing from worker results, plus the same allocation cleanup in sim-time reduction, so the patch stays in one allowed file and doesn’t change engine semantics.
