I still isolated a minimal patch for [engine-fast-par-worker.js](/g:/マイドライブ/プログラミング/github/fact_sim/js/app/engine-fast-par-worker.js): build a `nodeById` cache once in `preparePartitionGraph`, then use that cache in `collectOutgoingMessages` and `applyRemoteMessages`, and hoist the dirty-set lookup out of the per-message loop. I syntax-checked the transformed file at [engine-fast-par-worker.updated.js](/C:/Users/suzuk/.codex/memories/engine-fast-par-worker.updated.js) and saved the exact diff at [event-fast-par-worker-node-cache.patch](/C:/Users/suzuk/.codex/memories/event-fast-par-worker-node-cache.patch).

